    "代码引用测试文稿--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "代码引用测试文稿--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "代码引用测试文稿--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "e2e/code.spec.ts 的测试文稿：引用 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "cart.ts",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "，它的提交历史是文稿的一部分。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "code-steps--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "code-steps--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "code-steps--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "引用业务仓库中的代码，不把代码复制进文稿。代码来自 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "e2e/fixtures/code/cart.ts",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 的 checkout 区间，锁定在提交 10a2a63；幻灯片标题栏和网页代码块上的链接指向远端仓库中这个提交的对应行，徽标显示工作区中的代码是否已经改变。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "code-steps--code-1": {
      "id": "code-steps--code-1",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "ts",
      "origin": {
        "anchor": "region:e2e/fixtures/code/cart.ts#checkout",
        "pin": "10a2a63",
        "repo": "https://github.com/Lincyaw/presmium",
        "highlightRegions": {
          "code-steps--step-0": "validate",
          "code-steps--step-1": "price",
          "code-steps--step-2": "receipt"
        }
      }
    },
    "code-steps--paragraph-2": {
      "id": "code-steps--paragraph-2",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "code-steps--paragraph-2--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第一步：购物车为空时直接报错。嵌套的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "#region",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 标出逻辑单元，编译时换算成每一步高亮的行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "code-steps--paragraph-3": {
      "id": "code-steps--paragraph-3",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "code-steps--paragraph-3--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第二步：按数量计算小计，再算出优惠券折扣。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "code-steps--paragraph-4": {
      "id": "code-steps--paragraph-4",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "code-steps--paragraph-4--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第三步：生成收据文本。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
